OL,3,GNEWSAHow a cleaner was wrongfully
OL,4,Aimprisoned over asylum seeker leaks
OL,5,
OL,6,F13 August: It was reported Norfolk
OL,7,FPolice had arrested a man as part of an
OL,8,Finquiry into how the addresses of
OL,9,Fasylum seekers were shared during
OL,10,Fdisorder linked to the recent
OL,11,Fanti-immigration protests in Thetford
OL,13,F18 August: Jobson appears in court
OL,14,Fcharged with misconduct in public
OL,15,Foffice. This was announced by Norfolk
OL,16,FPolice which has since removed the
OL,17,Fpress release from its website
